{
  "name": "Meetings & files",
  "description": "Every meeting, call, diligence interview, IC meeting, board meeting and filed document — each linked to exactly one project.",
  "position": 1,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "log-meeting",
      "label": {
        "en": "Turn a meeting transcript into minutes",
        "zh-CN": "把会议转写整理成纪要"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder, then the `dealflow-meeting-notes` skill, and follow them. Turn the transcript or notes I give you into one meeting record: minutes, key findings, open questions, and follow-ups with owners and dates. Link it to the right existing project; only create a project after checking it does not exist.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，再读 `dealflow-meeting-notes` Skill，按它们的流程做。把我给你的会议转写或笔记整理成一条会议记录：纪要、关键发现、疑问与风险，以及带负责人和日期的待跟进。关联到正确的已有项目；确认不存在之后才新建项目。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "file-document",
      "label": {
        "en": "File a document under its project",
        "zh-CN": "把一份资料归档到项目下"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder, then the `dealflow-meeting-notes` skill, and follow them. File the document I attach (BP, board pack, diligence report) as a \"Filed document\" record under its project, with a three-line summary of what it says and what is new compared with earlier meetings.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，再读 `dealflow-meeting-notes` Skill，按它们的流程做。把我附上的资料（BP、董事会材料、尽调报告）作为「资料归档」记录挂到对应项目下，写三行摘要：讲了什么、和之前的会议比有什么新信息。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "what-we-heard",
      "label": {
        "en": "What did we hear about a topic across meetings?",
        "zh-CN": "跨会议查一个话题我们听到了什么"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder and follow it. Search the minutes and key findings for the topic I give and list what each meeting said about it, newest first, with the project and date. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，按它的规则做。在纪要和关键发现里查我给的话题，按时间倒序列出每次会议对它的说法，带上项目和日期。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
